#Post-RPSBLAST Processing Utility

#Input data file:	arch/three.asn
#Output data file:	(stdout)
#Annotation data at:	data
#E-Value cutoff:	0.01
#Redundancy:	Full
#Data requested:	Site annotations
#Output format -- tab-delimited table
#Show superfamilies: YES
#DATA
#SESSION	<session-ordinal>	<program>	<database>	<score-matrix>	<evalue-threshold>
#QUERY	<query-id>	<seq-type>	<seq-length>	<definition-line>
#SITES
#<session-ordinal>	<query-id[readingframe]>	<annot-type>	<title>	<residue(coordinates)>	<complete-size>	<mapped-size>	<source-domain>
#more such lines......
#ENDSITES
#MOTIFS
#<session-ordinal>	<query-id[readingframe]>	<title>	<from>	<to>	<source-domain>
#more such lines......
#ENDMOTIFS
#ENDQUERY	<query-id>
#more query sections..
#ENDSESSION	<session-ordinal>
#more session sections..
#ENDDATA
#=====================================================================
DATA
SESSION	1	blastp	2.17.0+	Cdd	BLOSUM62	0.01
QUERY	Query_1	Peptide	176	NP_417964.1 putative DNA-binding transcriptional regulator DctR [Escherichia coli str. K-12 substr. MG1655]
SITES
1	Query_1	Specific	DNA binding residues	S117,R118,K119,T132,T133,E134,I142,S143,K145,T146,Y148,C149,H150,K151,H152,I163	16	16	99777
1	Query_1	Specific	dimerization interface	A128,Q130,T132,I163,N164,E165,R168,H171,I172	9	9	99777
ENDSITES
ENDQUERY
QUERY	Query_2	Peptide	8	YP_009518762.2 protein YmdG [Escherichia coli str. K-12 substr. MG1655]
ENDQUERY
QUERY	Query_3	Peptide	250	NP_416077.4 putative antitermination protein Q [Escherichia coli str. K-12 substr. MG1655]
SITES
1	Query_3	Specific	Zn binding sites	C113,C116,C148,C151,C161,C164,C187,C190	8	8	199908
ENDSITES
ENDQUERY
ENDSESSION	1
ENDDATA
